" Checkbox cycling and parent [n/m] / [%] cookies.

Given org (cycle [ ] → [X] → [-] → [ ], and [] counts as empty):
  - [] item

Execute:
  call org#checkbox#toggle()
  AssertEqual '- [X] item', getline(1)
  call org#checkbox#toggle()
  AssertEqual '- [-] item', getline(1)
  call org#checkbox#toggle()
  AssertEqual '- [ ] item', getline(1)

Given org (a line without a checkbox is left alone):
  - plain item

Execute:
  call org#checkbox#toggle()

Expect org:
  - plain item

